    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1118">

                <pb facs="0838" n="762" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg762"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.6363/221</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Silliman
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-13T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 13, 1916, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your telegram January 25, 7 p.m. As stated Department’s January 21, 5 p.m., stock
                    Compañia Petrolera Maritima owned by American citizens. Statement of Foreign
                    Secretary that interests Mexican citizens only concerned is inaccurate and his
                    reply unsatisfactory. It is important that <hi rendition="#italic">de facto</hi>
                    Government state its views and position on questions presented by this case.</p>
                <p>Renew representations in behalf company.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
